\end{aligned}$
Put $t=\log \left[\frac{g(x)}{f(x)}\right]d t=d\left(\log \left[\frac{g(x)}{f(x)}\right]\right)$
Now, $\quad I=\int t d t=\frac{t^2}{2}+C=\frac{1}{2}\left\{\log \frac{g(x)}{f(x)}\right\}^2+C$

